{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_010B70","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"人生这东西，真是难以预料啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"怎么突然说起这个？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"我和你是在战场上以敌人的身份相遇的，可现在却像这样并肩作战。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"你是说哥伦比亚那次？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"对。我离开自卫队，辗转流落到哥伦比亚，明明连实战经验都没有，却一下子当上了革命势力的指导教官。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":141,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"看来你那时候就很会用西班牙语谈生意了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"别拿我开玩笑了。倒霉的是，你当时受雇于政府军一方。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"AUX_EXPANSION_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我到现在都忘不了。事情只发生在一瞬间。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"你们一发动伏击，我的部队瞬间就倒下一半。我一下慌了神，脑子里一片空白。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"之后我的指挥也乱得一塌糊涂，最后整支部队全灭……我自己也被诡雷炸成重伤，差点没命。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":"AUX_BOOBY_TRAP_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"然后，当我要离开时，你冲着我喊道……「我是自己选择从日本来到这里的。因为战场才是我的归宿。」","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":138,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"然后你又说「我想亲自做个了断」，求我替你介错。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":"AUX_KAISHAKU_NUANCE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"我还记得，当时我很惊讶，日本居然到现在还有武士活着。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"你们朝我靠了过来。那时我身上还藏着一颗手榴弹。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"可你那时反应也很快。我刚拔掉保险销，你就立刻用双手包住了我握着手榴弹的那只手。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"因为我不想让它爆炸。我听说武士很看重自尊，所以想知道，为什么一个武士会用这种卑鄙手段，想拉着敌人一起死。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":156,"review_flag":"AUX_CROSS_ROW_SPLIT_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"我说：「我……<R=我们,日本人>再也不会输了。」","cn_control_tokens":"<R=我们,日本人>","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"对。你说：「不管用什么手段，都绝不能输。」","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"我当时已经失血过多，就那样昏了过去。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"再次醒来时，我已经躺在你营地的医务室里，身上连着一大堆管子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"为什么要救我这个敌人，救一个刚才还想杀你的人？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"那时的你，甚至不惜舍弃<R=自尊,武士>也要继续战斗。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=自尊,武士>","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"我可不想打必输的仗……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"直到临死前，甚至明知自己要死，也仍然谋划计策。那才是真正的战士。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":"AUX_CROSS_ROW_SPLIT_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"不是得失，也不是胜负。那时我看着你的活法，找到了自己该走的路——作为战士的路。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"哦，这我倒不知道。所以你才把我……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"我明白了，战场并不只是把人筛分成敌人和同伴的装置。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"有时，它还能替你筛出既非敌人也非友军、却更胜于此的伙伴。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"就像我和你？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"对。那以后，已经过了两年……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":"AUX_EXPANSION_IGNORED"}]}